## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design low-latency, multi-region, multi-tenant feature flag architecture with strong isolation, auditable history, and safe rollout mechanisms.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant flags and isolation
- Azure App Configuration, Azure Redis Cache
- API Management, Front Door traffic splitting
- Canary rollouts and versioned audits in Cosmos DB
- Rollback strategies and testing approaches

## Code Example

```javascript
async function getFlag(tenantId, flagName){
  const key=`${tenantId}:${flagName}`;
  let v=cache.get(key);
  if(v!==undefined) return v;
  v=await appConfig.get(key);
  cache.set(key,v,30000);
  return v;
}
```

